    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3194380/extras/813a1dabd63670a1a02f217b8bcf817e.poster.avif?t=1741037315\" width=620 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3194380/extras/813a1dabd63670a1a02f217b8bcf817e.webm?t=1741037315\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3194380/extras/813a1dabd63670a1a02f217b8bcf817e.mp4?t=1741037315\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Signal: Uncharted Lands</strong> is a visual novel set in an unusual post-apocalyptic world. Members of a new civilization set out to uncover a mysterious signal. Where does this signal come from? What dangers await the explorers on their journey through uncharted wastelands? Will they reach their goal, or will something stand in their way? Find answers to these and other questions in this novel!<br><br><strong>In this game you'll be:</strong><br><br>\ud83d\udc3e Traveling with a group of quirky explorers, facing dangers, making new friends, and discovering interesting things;<br><br>\ud83d\udc3e Learning more about the previous civilization of this world;<br><br>\ud83d\udc3e Making decisions that will affect the course of the game and its ending;<br><br>\ud83d\udc3e Solving puzzles and participating in quizze;<br><br>\ud83d\udc3e Laughing at all the references and Easter eggs.",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3194380/extras/813a1dabd63670a1a02f217b8bcf817e.poster.avif?t=1741037315\" width=620 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3194380/extras/813a1dabd63670a1a02f217b8bcf817e.webm?t=1741037315\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3194380/extras/813a1dabd63670a1a02f217b8bcf817e.mp4?t=1741037315\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Signal: Uncharted Lands</strong> is a visual novel set in an unusual post-apocalyptic world. Members of a new civilization set out to uncover a mysterious signal. Where does this signal come from? What dangers await the explorers on their journey through uncharted wastelands? Will they reach their goal, or will something stand in their way? Find answers to these and other questions in this novel!<br><br><strong>In this game you'll be:</strong><br><br>\ud83d\udc3e Traveling with a group of quirky explorers, facing dangers, making new friends, and discovering interesting things;<br><br>\ud83d\udc3e Learning more about the previous civilization of this world;<br><br>\ud83d\udc3e Making decisions that will affect the course of the game and its ending;<br><br>\ud83d\udc3e Solving puzzles and participating in quizze;<br><br>\ud83d\udc3e Laughing at all the references and Easter eggs.",
    "short_description": "Embark on a journey with four adorable explorers! Uncover all the secrets of a post-apocalyptic world, meet the future inhabitants of Earth and enjoy plenty of Easter eggs. Your choices will shape the game's ending, so choose wisely! Or try a second playthrough to catch all the fun moments!",
